      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on Bluetooth Core v5.3, Vol6, Part B, 2.3.4, the size of AdvData can be calculated by subtracting 1-byte (Extended Header Length + AdvMode) and Extended Header from PDU payload. I was assuming AdvDataInfo is mandatory, which leads to 251-byte of a maximal AdvData (\u003d255-1-3), but this is not always valid. I\u0027ll use 254-byte as max AdvData for this case.",
